  "title": "Hawthorn Bancshares Reports First Quarter 2026 Results",
  "summary": "JEFFERSON CITY, Mo., April 29, 2026 (GLOBE NEWSWIRE) - Hawthorn Bancshares, Inc. (NASDAQ: HWBK) , (the “Company”), the bank holding company for Hawthorn Bank, reported first quarter 2026 net income of $6.8 million, or earnings per diluted share (“EPS”) of $0.98. First Quarter 2026 Results Net income improved $1.4 million, or 25.9% , to $6.8 million from the first quarter 2025 (the \"prior year quarter\") and the efficiency ratio improved to 60.46% compared to 66.64% for the prior year quarter EPS",
